<p begin="00:00:00.320" end="00:00:03.449" style="s2">[Applause]</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.120" end="00:00:17.940" style="s2">those people who are online making fun</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.559" end="00:00:21.390" style="s2">of members of Congress are disgrace and</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.940" end="00:00:22.830" style="s2">there&#39;s no need for anyone to think that</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.390" end="00:00:25.710" style="s2">is unacceptable</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.830" end="00:00:27.990" style="s2">we&#39;re going to shut them down and work</p>
<p begin="00:00:25.710" end="00:00:29.609" style="s2">with whoever it is to shut them back and</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.990" end="00:00:32.759" style="s2">they should be prosecuted</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.609" end="00:00:35.730" style="s2">you cannot intimidate members of</p>
<p begin="00:00:32.759" end="00:00:38.370" style="s2">Congress threat not threaten members of</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.730" end="00:00:43.070" style="s2">Congress it is against the law and it&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.370" end="00:00:43.070" style="s2">a shame in this United States of America</p>
